    "preview": "Share ad revenue data with partners\nPremium\nUpdated\nSeptember 15, 2026 11:11\nAt a glance:\nAllow partners to receive ad revenue information from mediation networks so they can optimize their user acquisition (UA) campaigns.\nNote\n: This requires an ROI360 Advanced subscription.\nAbout sharing ad revenue data with partners\nYou can allow ad networks responsible for user acquisition to receive ad revenue data from mediation networks. The partners can then use the information to optimize their UA campaigns.\nPartners can receive ad revenue data via eit"
