    "preview": "Help Center\n|\nMediation platform revenue SDK connections\nGrowth solution\n:\nRevWorks is available as an Adjust Growth Solution. To get RevWorks on your account, contact\nsales@adjust.com\n.\nAdjust has SDK plugins for various mediation platforms that allow the Adjust SDK to share impression-level ad revenue data and record the revenue generated from impressions for your campaigns.\nProvides ad revenue data in real-time.\nUse this solution if you want to work with SKAdNetwork using\nconversion values\nmapped to revenue ranges. Find out more with Convers"
